<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
<strong>Things don’t always go to plan</strong><br />
While safety is our number one priority, I understand how inconvenient the delay must have been for you and would like to apologise for any impact this had on your plans.<br />
<br />
<strong>Our commitment to high standards</strong><br />
We know the importance of great communication in situations like this, so I’m sorry to hear our airport team did not manage this delay as well as expected.<br />
<br />
I want to assure you that we’re committed to improving our delay handling processes when unforeseen issues happen.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If offering goodwill gesture to Frequent Flyer:-</strong></em><br />
As a gesture of goodwill, I’ve credited {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to your Frequent Flyer account.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If not a Frequent Flyer: -</strong></em><br />
<br />
As a gesture of goodwill, I’d like to arrange a credit of {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to you. Please can you let me know your Frequent Flyer number by replying to this email so I can credit points to your account. If you’re not already a member you can use this link to join <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/discover-and-join/join-now.html/code/FAMILYFREE">free</a>&nbsp;of charge.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion&nbsp;</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with an exceptional experience from start to finish.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to tell us about your experience and I hope we deliver an exceptional service next time you fly with Qantas.<br />
&nbsp;</body>
</html>